      "name": "Vanguard's Coordinated Tactics",
      "icon": "UI_Talent_S_Chevreuse_05",
      "value": "With only Pyro and Electro party members (at least one of each): after Overloaded, the enemy has -40% Pyro and Electro RES for 6 s.",
      "toggleFlag": "pyroElectroParty",
      "note": "Simulated on her own Overloaded (option). Varesa gets it from her own Overloaded.",
      "description": "When all party members are Pyro and Electro characters and there is at least one Pyro and one Electro character each in the party:\nChevreuse grants \"Coordinated Tactics\" to nearby party members: After a character triggers the Overloaded reaction, the Pyro and Electro RES of the opponent(s) affected by this Overloaded reaction will be decreased by 40% for 6s.\nThe \"Coordinated Tactics\" effect will be removed when the Elemental Types of the characters in the party do not meet the basic requirements for the Ascension Talent."
    },
    {
      "id": "chevreuse-passive-2",
